<!--
Super-Kamiokande 2023 Data Fit Configuration

Full standard oscillation data fit with real SK data:
  7 flux + 4 cross-section + 21 detector = 32 nuisance parameters
  (decay_e_tagging EXCLUDED - SuperK_2023 doesn't set DecayE)
  (9 Mode-dependent xsec params EXCLUDED - h5 file lacks NEUT mode field)

Oscillation parameters (dCP, Sin2Theta13, Sin2Theta12, Dm221) are profiled
programmatically in the row worker, not scanned in XML.

Based on SK2023_Atm_fullsyst.xml with DataFiles enabled.
-->
